&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The protagonist, Kinoshita Kouichi, works for an insurance company and is sent to investigate the death of a famous painter. He goes to the painter&amp;rsquo;s house and meets his four beautiful daughters. Can he solve the mystery without being killed himself?&lt;/p&gt;
